# VISBOT — Visitor Management SaaS

> ⚠️ This is VISBOT. Not WaBot. Not any other project.
> Always work inside this folder only.

## Project Structure
```
visbot/
├── frontend/   → Next.js 14 App Router  (Vercel)   port 3000
├── backend/    → Node.js + Express       (Railway)  port 4000
├── supabase/   → Migrations + RLS schema
└── src/        → Shared TypeScript types
```

## Stack
| Layer    | Tech                                      |
|----------|-------------------------------------------|
| Frontend | Next.js 14, Tailwind, Supabase SSR        |
| Backend  | Express, Bull queue, JWT, ioredis         |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Realtime + Auth)   |
| Cache    | Redis (Railway)                           |
| SMS/OTP  | Fast2SMS (India) / Twilio                 |
| Media    | Cloudinary or Supabase Storage            |
| Deploy   | Vercel (frontend) + Railway (backend)     |

## Key Features
1. **Visitor check-in** — form → webcam photo → OTP verify → DB insert
2. **Returning visitor** — phone lookup → OTP auto-send → fast check-in
3. **Material in/out** — log items with direction, return alerts via Bull queue
4. **Live dashboard** — Supabase Realtime websocket feed
5. **Multi-tenant SaaS** — subdomain routing, Row-Level Security per company

